---
import DirectButton from "../../GlobalComponents/DirectButton/DirectButton";
---

<section
  id="hero"
  class="overflow-hidden py-2 px-5 md:px-5 lg:px-15 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-[100vh] md:min-h-[100vh] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-14 justify-evenly md:justify-between items-center transition-all duration-400 relative"
  aria-labelledby="hero-title"
>
  <!-- Left Content -->
  <div
    class="z-10 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left"
  >
    <header>
      <p class="text-md md:text-lg">Selamat Datang di</p>
      <h1
        id="hero-title"
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-3 uppercase font-semibold"
      >
        e-Lapor
      </h1>
    </header>

    <p class="w-full max-w-sm text-sm md:text-base md:text-justify">
      Platform ini dirancang untuk memfasilitasi pelaporan temuan di lingkungan
      sekolah dan mengelolanya dalam satu sistem terintegrasi, guna
      <b>
        mendukung visualisasi, analisis, dan pengambilan keputusan berbasis
        data.
      </b>
    </p>

    <div class="flex items-center md:justify-start justify-center mt-4 md:mt-5">
      <DirectButton label="Lapor Sekarang" client:only />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Right Image -->
  <figure
    class="about-main-image w-[80vw] h-[40vh] md:w-[24vw] md:h-[38vh] border-2 border-[var(--primary)]/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm shadow shadow-white hover:shadow-lg overflow-hidden md:py-8 md:px-4 py-12 px-6 rounded-xl relative duration-400 hover:scale-105"
  >
    <span class="blinky"></span>
    <figcaption class="sr-only">Tampilan formulir pelaporan e-Lapor</figcaption>

    <!-- Fake window header -->
    <div>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-red-600 rounded-full absolute top-3 left-4"
      ></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full absolute top-3 left-8"
      ></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-500 rounded-full absolute top-3 left-12"
      ></span>
      <span
        class="text-center font-semibold text-sm absolute top-0.5 left-0 right-0"
      >
        Report Form
      </span>
    </div>

    <img
      src="/img/reportScreenshot.png"
      class="w-fit h-full mx-auto object-cover aspect-square rounded-xl"
      alt="Tangkapan layar halaman formulir laporan e-Lapor"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </figure>

  <style>
    span.blinky {
      width: 200%;
      height: 25%;
      transform-origin: 50% 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-50%) rotate(-45deg);
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    }

    .about-main-image:hover > span.blinky {
      animation-name: blinky-anim;
      animation-duration: 2.5s;
      animation-timing-function: linear;
      animation-iteration-count: infinite;
    }

    @keyframes blinky-anim {
      0% {
        top: -25%;
        left: -25%;
        opacity: 0.5;
      }
      25% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50% {
        top: 125%;
        left: 125%;
        opacity: 0.5;
      }
      100% {
        top: 125%;
        left: 125%;
        opacity: 0.5;
      }
    }
  </style>
</section>
